    "message": "Due to an inconsistent use of Tuple/ValueTuple in ZipWith() and MakeBatches() extension method, unexpected CastExceptions can occur if you try to use MakeBatches() with a set of items with given sizes. Please  no longer use this version.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy",
      "CriticalBugs"
    ]
  },
